+  ⚠ The count was NOT unreasoned — `10_home.md` measured that twelve filled the first screenful
+  across two or three competitions on every day sampled. It fails on a different axis: it does not
+  SCALE. As competitions are onboarded, twelve slots hold fewer and fewer of them, so the block
+  narrows exactly as the site broadens. Measured on the committed sample: 12 fixtures spanning TWO
+  dates, which is not a matchday and reads as an arbitrary cut.
